{"line":"T77.C.01","text":"Das ist die ursprüngliche Bedeutung. „AGI“ wurde in den 2000ern (Gubrud, Goertzel, Legg) als Gegenteil von enger KI bekannt: ein System für viele Gebiete, im Gegensatz zu einer Schach-Engine. Über das Niveau sagte es nichts. Nach dieser wörtlichen Lesart erfüllen Ell-Ell-Ems die Bedingung, und Norvig und Agüera y Arcas haben genau das 2023 argumentiert.","lufs":-18.77,"alignment":{"characters":["D","a","s"," ","i","s","t"," ","d","i","e"," ","u","r","s","p","r","ü","n","g","l","i","c","h","e"," ","B","e","d","e","u","t","u","n","g","."," ","„","A","G","I","“"," ","w","u","r","d","e"," ","i","n"," ","d","e","n"," ","2","0","0","0","e","r","n"," ","(","G","u","b","r","u","d",","," ","G","o","e","r","t","z","e","l",","," ","L","e","g","g",")"," ","a","l","s"," ","G","e","g","e","n","t","e","i","l"," ","v","o","n"," ","e","n","g","e","r"," ","K","I"," ","b","e","k","a","n","n","t",":"," ","e","i","n"," ","S","y","s","t","e","m"," ","f","ü","r"," ","v","i","e","l","e"," ","G","e","b","i","e","t","e",","," ","i","m"," ","G","e","g","e","n","s","a","t","z"," ","z","u"," ","e","i","n","e","r"," ","S","c","h","a","c","h","-","E","n","g","i","n","e","."," ","Ü","b","e","r"," ","d","a","s"," ","N","i","v","e","a","u"," ","s","a","g","t","e"," ","e","s"," ","n","i","c","h","t","s","."," ","N","a","c","h"," ","d","i","e","s","e","r"," ","w","ö","r","t","l","i","c","h","e","n"," ","L","e","s","a","r","t"," ","e","r","f","ü","l","l","e","n"," ","E","l","l","-","E","l","l","-","E","m","s"," ","d","i","e"," ","B","e","d","i","n","g","u","n","g",","," ","u","n","d"," ","N","o","r","v","i","g"," ","u","n","d"," ","A","g","ü","e","r","a"," ","y"," ","A","r","c","a","s"," ","h","a","b","e","n"," ","g","e","n","a","u"," ","d","a","s"," ","2","0","2","3"," ","a","r","g","u","m","e","n","t","i","e","r","t","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.08,0.16,0.24,0.3,0.36,0.42,0.48,0.5,0.52,0.54,0.56,0.64,0.72,0.8,0.88,0.907,0.933,0.96,1.04,1.12,1.152,1.184,1.216,1.